 runtime/README.md          |  10 +-
 runtime/shims/xmem.cpp     | 467 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 runtime/test/xmem_test.cpp | 261 ++++++++++++++++++++-
 4 files changed, 723 insertions(+), 38 deletions(-)

